flowchart LR

classDef state fill:#F8FAFC,stroke:#475569,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:1.3px;
classDef action fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.4px;
classDef wait fill:#FCE7F3,stroke:#BE185D,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.4px;
classDef resume fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#15803D,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.4px;

R1[Step Failure]:::state
R2[Bounded Retry]:::action
R3{Recovered?}:::state
R4[Patch Top-K]:::action
R5{Gate}:::state
R6[WAITING_PATCH_CONFIRM]:::wait
R7[Apply Patch<br/>Resume RUNNING]:::resume
R8[Replan Candidate]:::action
R9[WAITING_REPLAN_CONFIRM]:::wait
R10[Suffix Replan Preferred<br/>Resume RUNNING]:::resume

R1 --> R2 --> R3
R3 -- yes --> R7
R3 -- no --> R4 --> R5
R5 -- auto --> R7
R5 -- HITL patch --> R6 --> R7
R5 -- high risk / exhausted --> R8 --> R9 --> R10
